      "writtenOn": "2020-11-19T00:41:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s suppose there were originally \"foo\", \"bar\", and \"baz\", three apex variations, but \"foo\" and \"bar\" have been merged into \"apex29_qux_3\". What will be the value of ApexInfo.InApexes of the \"apex29_qux_3\" variant? Is it {\"foo\", \"bar\", \"baz\"} or {\"foo\", \"bar\"}? Asking it because the comment alludes it\u0027s the former, but mergeApexVariations and InApex make me believe it\u0027s the latter.",
      "revId": "e6c59d8870b4dac981e4aa401bfeccd8913e1a65",
